  "description": "Stronger hill climbing capability, and stable power under heavier cargo or larger riders\n\nHandles 45° slopes with ease, delivering 130–140 Nm of torque, with 3500W rated power and 4000W peak power. Ideal for hilly city commuting and mountain trails with consistent grade changes.\n\nDeliver stable, linear, and quiet power during high-speed or long-distance rides, with smooth and steady acceleration when speeding up, avoid gear motor wear, reduce maintenance, and lower long-term costs.\n\n80AH large battery capacity provides longer range , only 1–2 charges per week\n\nRide over 200 miles on a single charge with certified battery reliability you can count on.\n\nSmart BMS, EV‑grade cells, IP67 sealing, and impact‑resistant casing keep every ride protected.\n\nSmoother handling and long-ride comfort\n\nAbsorbs impacts from potholes, cracks, and uneven pavement to improve comfort and handling. Reduces vibration through the handlebars, helping minimize wrist and arm fatigue during longer rides\n\nHelps smooth out rough pavement and bumpy roads for a more comfortable riding experience. Reduces stress on the lower back and improves comfort during long commutes, delivery shifts, or weekend rides\n\nInstant adjustments, clearer feedback, and smoother handling for a more comfortable, intuitive ride",
